# metoprolol.msf
# Metoprolol  pKa=9.670 (isopropylammonium→amine, q=+1→0)
# Source: Avdeef 2001
# Beta-1 selective blocker. Similar scaffold to propranolol but phenyl
# instead of naphthyl ether (lower ΔBO_ring expected). The methoxyethyl
# para substituent withdraws slightly, explaining pKa=9.67 > propranolol
# (9.53). Comparison tests the model's resolution between similar amines.

